Embedded BambuStudio configuration data

The following print projects embed BambuStudio configuration data:

- reorient/hardware/cube.3mf contains
  Metadata/project_settings.config, which parses as a complete configuration
  with 557 keys.
- hardware/hand1/base.3mf contains
  Metadata/project_settings.config, which parses as a complete configuration
  with 559 keys.
- hardware/hand2/base.3mf contains
  Metadata/project_settings.config, which parses as a complete configuration
  with 581 keys. Its recorded printer_model is `Bambu Lab H2C`,
  printer_settings_id is `Bambu Lab H2C 0.4 nozzle`, and
  default_filament_profile is `Bambu PLA Basic @BBL H2C`.

The values originate from BambuStudio resources/profiles/BBL data. Bundle
evidence includes change_filament_gcode text such as
`;======== H2C filament_change ========` and default_filament_profile values
`Bambu PLA Basic @BBL H2C` and `Bambu PLA Basic @BBL P1S 0.4 nozzle`.
The upstream project is <https://github.com/bambulab/BambuStudio>; its
repository license at
<https://github.com/bambulab/BambuStudio/blob/master/LICENSE> is AGPL-3.0.

Release eligibility and any attribution or source obligations for the embedded
configuration data remain for the release reviewer to confirm. This notice
records facts only. Retaining the configuration is intentional because the
print and slicing settings are necessary downstream information for these
print projects.

