ONNX producer metadata

reorient/checkpoints/hand1/policy.onnx and
reorient/checkpoints/hand2/policy.onnx both record `pytorch 2.7.1` as the
ONNX producer. Both also embed a `wuji_policy_identity` metadata entry; the
Hand 2 entry identifies policy schema 1 and robot generation 2 and matches
the required `reorient/checkpoints/hand2/config.json` sidecar. `rsl_rl`
appears as the training-framework name in the manifest; this bundle does
not contain rsl_rl source code.

Hand 2 checkpoint provenance

The matched files in reorient/checkpoints/hand2/ come from run
`RewardContactFix_Full_s42`, trained with code commit
`a72f60c8dc3d81e02b53ed63f17353c74ed91737` for task
`WujiHand2_Reorient_50Hz`. The run's `model_4999.pt` is distributed as
`model.pt`; the exported `policy.onnx` carries generation identity and is
paired with its matching `config.json`. Training scale and seed are recorded
in reorient/manifest.json from the run's params/env.yaml and params/agent.yaml.
This set replaces the previously bundled Hand 2 checkpoint.

