PenSpin additions in the combined bundle

Pen CAD was supplied by the project maintainer. The source STEP contains two alternative shafts named 250 and 240;
both assemblies measure 250 mm overall. Exported filenames and part labels use
ring/cross names. Geometry, colors, component placements and all end-block
solids are retained. Source names and the original SHA-256 are recorded in
pen_spin/manifest.json. Open CASCADE 7.8.1 was used for STEP import/export.

The PenSpin PNG artwork and deployment layout JSON are copied unchanged from
the integration repository revision recorded in the PenSpin manifest.
The texture_faces.csv table records face dimensions and marker IDs derived
from the deployment layout and existing texture slot arrangement.
Print settings, datasets and policies are documented in the task manifest.


PenSpin trajectory data

The 40 NPZ clips, five group indexes and five recipes in pen_spin/data/
were copied without modification from the user-designated integration
working tree's src/wuji_mjlab/tasks/pen_spin/data/ directories. File digests
are recorded in the group indexes and SHA256SUMS. They use the physical
wrist frame recorded in pen_spin/manifest.json.

PenSpin policy checkpoints

Five matched policy sets are included in pen_spin/checkpoints/, one per
motion group. Each set contains model.pt, policy.onnx and config.json.
The model.pt files were copied
byte-for-byte from the maintainer-selected regular five-group training
runs and renamed for this release. The training source revision is
37c71a478905369e2072d3e3bc39484ad38774b6. The corresponding ONNX exports are included; file digests are recorded
in pen_spin/manifest.json and SHA256SUMS.


PenSpin production source files

The production resources include two maintainer-supplied 3MF projects and
one STEP assembly, copied byte-for-byte under pen_spin/hardware/.
The 3MF projects contain Bambu Lab X2D printer profiles and Bambu PLA Basic
filament settings. The STEP assembly is a separate source from the split
ring/cross exports. File digests are recorded in pen_spin/manifest.json
and SHA256SUMS.
